# Data
# NOTE: APL_Logistics.csv and the pretrained model artifacts (model.pkl,
# scaler.pkl, feature_cols.json, metrics.json) are intentionally NOT
# ignored. Streamlit Community Cloud deploys straight from this GitHub
# repo with no access to your local machine, so both the dataset and the
# pretrained model need to live in git — see docs/project-brief.md for
# why the app loads a pretrained model instead of training on every
# cold start. Regenerate all four by running scripts/train_model.py.
